47 +08:00\">20h 50m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>ultra 几下就用完了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17944688\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4710/9e92/275835_normal.png?m=1761277786\" alt=\"suyuyu\" data-uid=\"275835\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/suyuyu\">suyuyu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 14:18:44 +08:00\">20h 46m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>sol 根本耐不住我用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17944753\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5dbc74a7ea4be6f425559141293b4a59?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"MX123\" data-uid=\"325135\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/MX123\">MX123</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 14:27:41 +08:00\">20h 37m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>都是狠人，才用 2%</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17944761\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/891f/c90e/499149_normal.png?m=1785720807\" alt=\"calvinHxx\" data-uid=\"499149\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/calvinHxx\">calvinHxx</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 14:28:33 +08:00\">20h 36m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>个人单项目 火力全开不到 2 天就差不多蹬完了 怎么可能蹬不完。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17944789\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/20a757a75227d8cb02c16ffc441e29c4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"azraeljack\" data-uid=\"433861\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/azraeljack\">azraeljack</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 14:33:45 +08:00\">20h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>用 5.6 sol + fast 的话 pro 周限额用的狠的话一天就能蹬完了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17944829\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/81865d92cb26408e850ce0289a7a5e30?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Kokomashiro\" data-uid=\"392987\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Kokomashiro\">Kokomashiro</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 14:41:50 +08:00\">20h 23m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>开 sol ultra 就会用的快，其他的正常用确实有点用不完，不开 sol ultra ，一天下来用 10%差不多。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17944833\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/57b94f7f153f3745286c0b8db7131786?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"layxy\" data-uid=\"428568\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/layxy\">layxy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 14:42:15 +08:00\">20h 23m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>如果真实刻意的想蹬完其实也快，真实项目需求蹬不完，所以我开了几个小项目做一些平时可能会用到的小工具</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17944948\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/dd57/438f/756608_normal.png?m=1785988148\" alt=\"yhc2073\" data-uid=\"756608\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yhc2073\">yhc2073</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 15:02:45 +08:00\">20h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>对 fast 巨费呀，真的是一天用完。  之前有重置卡就可劲用，没了后就关掉 fast 了，烧不起。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17945652\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4421b11e067d886a91a1dd831b847c2b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"fallimmortal\" data-uid=\"771761\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/fallimmortal\">fallimmortal</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 16:51:52 +08:00\">18h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我一般用的是 high ，ultra 确实好用一些吗？ 我感觉太慢了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17946903\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/519d/4bda/46579_normal.png?m=1570152015\" alt=\"JEFFMEME\" data-uid=\"46579\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19<